KG42.register("clusters-ba392a4a374559d574dc9547",{"id":"30-motivational_game::v142-d-K004","paper":"30-motivational_game","label":"Energy receiver role of network members","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K004","label":"Energy receiver role of network members","market_meaning":"A P2P network member may assume the shared-energy receiver role and may also simultaneously assume the resource-provider role, defining the role scope of demand-side participation.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"Limited to the general P2P member definition and the peer energy-purchase description in the introduction. The receiver role may overlap with the provider role and is not automatically equivalent to a pure consumer without generation capability, nor is the product scope of the specific PV-without-battery case extended on this basis.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"This is an independent definition of the member receiver role; the existing chains do not establish a dependency between this role and a specific coalition revenue allocation or transaction threshold. It is therefore retained as a single-chain candidate and is not merged into the price-incentive cluster merely because it belongs to the same participation stage.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Fully retain the qualitative role definition of the energy-receiving member and of the provider identity that such a member may also hold."}],"connections":[],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G012","category":"unverified_source","description":"The citations underlying the receiver and provider roles remain unverified; assembled only means that this role definition can independently form a candidate within the disclosed scope, and does not mean that the source or ontology mapping has been reviewed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::participation.consumer","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E06","v141-b-g01-E07"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the member definition and the extent to which receiver and provider identities may overlap, confirm that participation.consumer carries only the receiving function in this paper, and do not infer pure-consumer admission conditions on this basis."}]},"rule_refs":["30-motivational_game::v141-c-R004"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-acb8c66e9814835c"]});
